/*
 * Explicit template solving for value-level template parameters.
 *
 * TemplateExplicitValueSolving handles template parameters that must match a
 * *compile-time constant value*. This includes expressions such as:
 *
 *     42
 *     true
 *     'x'
 *     SOME_ENUM.VALUE
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::value
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/value.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-13
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
